# Add web-app environment variables here.
# Vite exposes only variables prefixed with VITE_ to browser code.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the values. .env.local is ignored
# by git (see the root .gitignore); this file is not, so it must never hold a
# real value.

# For the local stack, `supabase start` prints both of these.
# For a hosted project: Project Settings > API.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321

# The ANON / PUBLISHABLE key, and only that one.
#
# Everything here is compiled into a bundle served to the browser, so this key
# is public the moment it ships. The anon key is designed for that and is
# constrained by row level security.
#
# NEVER put the service role key (or an sb_secret_… key) here. It bypasses RLS
# entirely. src/lib/supabase.ts refuses to start if it finds one, but the guard
# is a backstop, not a permission slip.
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# ── THERE IS NO GATE FLAG ANY MORE ──────────────────────────────────────────
# `VITE_REQUIRE_ACCOUNT` is gone as of 2026-10-20. It chose between the sign-in
# gate and an anonymous session, and anonymous accounts were removed from the
# product — so there is one answer left and nothing to select between.
#
# No session means the sign-in screen, in every build, on every target. If you
# are looking for this variable because a deploy still sets it: it is read by
# nothing, and the Workers Builds entry wants deleting.

# ── POSTHOG · PRODUCT ANALYTICS AND SESSION REPLAY ──────────────────────────
# This project token is public: it is compiled into the browser bundle. Do not
# put personal API keys here.
#
# Leave BOTH blank for local work: with no key, lib/posthog.ts does not
# initialise and says so once on the console. Nothing else changes, and no
# screen behaves differently — the consent card still appears, because what it
# records is a decision about the product rather than about this variable.
#
# THE HOST DEFAULTS TO THE EU (https://eu.i.posthog.com) when unset, which is
# the only region this app may use: Frankfurt, the same as the Supabase
# project. The US cloud is a third-country transfer with nothing to recommend
# it — LEGAL-PAGES.md §4.5.
VITE_POSTHOG_KEY=
VITE_POSTHOG_HOST=
